<DocsPageTitle Path="Extensions/SVG Chart Data Labels">
    Blazorise SVG Chart Data Labels
</DocsPageTitle>

<DocsPageLead>
    Render labels around chart values and handle label interactions.
</DocsPageLead>

<DocsPageParagraph>
    SVG chart data labels are configured declaratively with <Code>SvgChartDataLabels</Code> or through <Code>SvgChartOptions.DataLabels</Code>. Use the formatter callback to customize label text per point.
</DocsPageParagraph>

<DocsPageSectionTitle>
    Examples
</DocsPageSectionTitle>

<DocsPageSection>
    <DocsPageSectionHeader Title="Value labels">
        Render formatted labels above column values and react to label events.
    </DocsPageSectionHeader>
    <DocsPageSectionContent Code="SvgChartDataLabelsExample" Outlined FullWidth>
        <SvgChartDataLabelsExample />
    </DocsPageSectionContent>
</DocsPageSection>

<DocsPageSection>
    <DocsPageSectionHeader Title="Radial labels">
        Render labels inside doughnut slices by configuring <Code>SvgChartOptions.DataLabels</Code>.
    </DocsPageSectionHeader>
    <DocsPageSectionContent Code="SvgChartDataLabelsDoughnutExample" Outlined FullWidth>
        <SvgChartDataLabelsDoughnutExample />
    </DocsPageSectionContent>
</DocsPageSection>

